<title>SPAIN: Spain 6-mo bills yield rose slightly at auction.</title>
<headline>Spain 6-mo bills yield rose slightly at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at Wednesday's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE  Yield   Pvs     Price    Pvs     Bid     Allocated</p>
<p> 6-mo  5.351   5.342   97.38    97.37  135.382   61.732</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
